      ],
      "source": "https://www.visitoregon.com/cities/pilot-rock-oregon/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Indigenous peoples, including the Umatilla, Cayuse, and Walla Walla tribes, inhabited the Pilot Rock area long before European settlers arrived.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
