      "source": "https://www.visitoregon.com/cities/pilot-rock-oregon/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town of Pilot Rock grew steadily through the development of the railroad industry, timber, and agriculture.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
