      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.visitoregon.com/cities/pilot-rock-oregon/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Pilot Rock Days is an annual event featuring a parade and live music to celebrate the city's history and culture.",
